{
  "inShort": "The devlog and linked media put the goal at risk. No build or test notes were shared, so progress toward the playable slice remains unknown. Mia has not confirmed work for two sprints, leaving co-op engineering capacity unconfirmed.",
  "discussed": [
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtkk82008ybnxz84yy1bm59",
      "text": "The public repository matches the task: Godot demos, an MIT license and import instructions. It supplies starting material, not evidence of the playable slice."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtkk85q08ycnxz8fmvua13e",
      "text": "The art reference remains done. Only the Big Buck Bunny title and thumbnail were checked, so its animation remains unverified."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtkk88z08ydnxz8c8d2wj8p",
      "text": "The article matches the promised playtesting reference. It explains testing methods, but does not document this game's player tests."
    }
  ],
  "notDiscussed": [],
  "outsidePlan": [
    "The devlog reports five players tested the tide loop, bringing testing forward. No playtest document was attached, so participation and findings remain unverified.",
    "The image labelled “The tide out” shows a mountain landscape, not the game's tide. The video link identifies Big Buck Bunny, not sailing gameplay. Neither demonstrates two islands, a changing sailing route or co-op."
  ],
  "questions": [
    "Where can readers open the reported five-player test notes and the build they tested?",
    "What did those players understand about the tide's effect on their route?",
    "With one sprint left, which parts of two-island co-op sailing are playable today?"
  ]
}

